"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I have the following setup:\n\n```\n<Route component={Application}>\n    <Route path=\"/website\" component={Website}>\n        <Route path=\"products\" component={WebsiteProducts}>\n            <Route path=\":productId\" component={WebsiteProductsProduct} />\n            <IndexRoute component={WebsiteProductsIndex} />\n        </Route>\n        <Route path=\"contact\" component={WebsiteContact} />\n        <IndexRoute component={WebsiteOverview} />\n    </Route>\n</Route>\n```\n\nWith the following links in a menu:\n\n```\n<Link to=\"/website\" onlyActiveOnIndex={true} activeClassName=\"active\">Overview</Link>\n<Link to=\"/website/products\" activeClassName=\"active\">Products</Link>\n<Link to=\"/website/products/15\" activeClassName=\"active\">Specific product</Link>\n<Link to=\"/website/contact\" activeClassName=\"active\">Contact</Link>\n```\n\nVisiting URL `/website` makes **overview** active, and visiting `/website/contact` makes the **contact** active, just as predicted.\n\nBut visiting URL `/website/products` makes _both_ **overview** and **products** active. But if I visit `/website/products/15` the **products** and **specific product** gets highlighted (as intended).\n\nSo the issue is that by visiting the products URL, the overview (which is a an IndexRoute) still gets active, why is this? I thought the prop `onlyActiveOnIndex` would prevent this from happening.\n","closed_by":{"login":"mjackson","id":92839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson","html_url":"https://github.com/mjackson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2066/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}